Spec: TODO App

Platform: JavaScript/ES6

Purpose:
  Single-page TODO application built with Vanilla JS ES6, OOP.

Owns:
  ./*

Structure:
  models/: Domain models
  services/: Business logic and storage
  components/: UI components with DOM responsibility
  index.html: Application entry point
  main.js: Bootstrap — mounts AppComponent into the DOM

Must:
  Use ES6 classes for all logic and UI components.
  Use OOP.
  No inline JavaScript is permitted.
  Separate model, service, and component responsibilities.
  Keep DOM manipulation inside components.
  Keep business logic inside services.
  Persist TODO state across page reloads in local storage.
  Maintain SRP for all services and features.
  Follow best JavaScript development practices.

Must not:
  Use external frameworks or libraries.
  Mix business logic into components.
  Access localStorage directly from components.

Forbids:
  jQuery
  React
  Vue
  Angular
